 "diagnosis": "The loop assigns pos but no loop invariant constrains it. After the loop Dafny only knows the invariants (bounds of i and arr unchanged) and the exit condition, so pos is arbitrary and the postcondition 'pos == -1 || (0 <= pos < arr.Length && arr[pos] == elem && ...)' cannot be derived. An invariant 'pos == -1 || (0 <= pos < i && arr[pos] == elem)' is needed to bridge the loop exit to the postcondition."}

